baba-theft-niigata-mapdata — licence
====================================

Database (the collection of files in data/ taken as a whole)
------------------------------------------------------------
This database is made available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0.
Full text: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
(Human-readable summary: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/summary/)

Contents of the database
------------------------
Individual contents derived from OpenStreetMap are made available under the
Database Contents License (DbCL) 1.0, as OpenStreetMap does:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/dbcl/1-0/

Contents derived from the sources below remain subject to their own terms
(attribution and the statement that they were processed are required):

- 3D都市モデル（Project PLATEAU）新潟市（2023年度） — 国土交通省（著作権者：新潟市）
  公共データ利用規約 第1.0版（PDL1.0）
  https://www.digital.go.jp/resources/open_data/public_data_license_v1.0
- 国土地理院 地理院タイル（全国最新写真（シームレス）） — 国土地理院コンテンツ利用規約
  https://www.gsi.go.jp/kikakuchousei/kikakuchousei40182.html
  (only the read-off layout of parking-lot lines in data/parking_lots.json; no image pixels)

